     1,
     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nDear all,</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nif you ever wanted to go to the wonderful Spanish island of Mallorca: here&#39;s THE opportunity, or actually, here are TWO opportunities. The Animal Demography and Ecology Unit at the CSIC institute of advanced studies in Esporles is hosting two excellent workshops\r\n at the end of this year. Please see here: <a href=\"http://animaldemography.blogspot.com/p/workshop.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://animaldemography.blogspot.com/p/workshop.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792449716173000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3JqOETJ6CJZgvZ8mB7xzE8\">\r\nhttp://animaldemography.blogspot.com/p/workshop.html</a><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div style=\"width:100%;margin-top:16px;margin-bottom:16px;max-width:800px;min-width:424px\">\r\n<table role=\"presentation\" style=\"padding:12px 36px 12px 12px;width:100%;border-width:1px;border-style:solid;border-color:rgb(200,200,200);border-radius:2px\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"border-spacing:0px\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<td>\r\n<div style=\"margin-right:12px;min-height:125.929px;overflow:hidden;width:240px\">\r\n<a href=\"http://animaldemography.blogspot.com/p/workshop.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://animaldemography.blogspot.com/p/workshop.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792449716173000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3JqOETJ6CJZgvZ8mB7xzE8\"><img alt=\"\" style=\"display:block\" width=\"240\" height=\"125\" src=\"https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-_s753pG2XPY/XTCP-23NuJI/AAAAAAAACDg/nrjoEndbuuU2EYbkL7pEgmyirBIyjYI0gCLcBGAs/w1200-h630-p-k-no-nu/Alimoche%2Badulto%2BAutor%2BJordi%2Bbas.jpg\"></a></div>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width:100%\">\r\n<div style=\"font-size:21px;font-weight:300;margin-right:8px;font-family:&quot;wf_segoe-ui_light&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Light&quot;,&quot;Segoe WP Light&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,&quot;Segoe WP&quot;,Tahoma,Arial,sans-serif;margin-bottom:12px\">\r\n<a href=\"http://animaldemography.blogspot.com/p/workshop.html\" style=\"text-decoration:none;color:var(--themePrimary)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://animaldemography.blogspot.com/p/workshop.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792449716173000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3JqOETJ6CJZgvZ8mB7xzE8\">Animal Demography and Ecology Unit: COURSE ON CAPTURE-RECAPTURE ANALYSES 2021</a></div>\r\n<div style=\"font-size:14px;max-height:100px;color:rgb(102,102,102);font-family:&quot;wf_segoe-ui_normal&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,&quot;Segoe WP&quot;,Tahoma,Arial,sans-serif;margin-bottom:12px;margin-right:8px;overflow:hidden\">\r\nThis introductory course aims to introduce students, researchers and environmental managers to the theory and practical aspects of the analysis of capture-mark-recapture and –recovery data to estimate survival, recruitment and dispersal probabil ities. The\r\n course is based on theoretical classes as well as practical sessions with real and simulated data.</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:400;color:rgb(166,166,166);font-family:&quot;wf_segoe-ui_normal&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,&quot;Segoe WP&quot;,Tahoma,Arial,sans-serif\">\r\n<a href=\"http://animaldemography.blogspot.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://animaldemography.blogspot.com&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792449716173000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0ZjG28n_oapSxrxLHuowH_\">animaldemography.blogspot.com</a></div>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nThe workshops will cover mostly analyses in MARK and E-SURGE, but a translation into the BUGS language of most models is not very hard (and is covered, for instance, in one monster chapter on the ingredients of Integrated Population Models in the upcoming book\r\n with Michael Schaub).<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nBest regards  --- Marc<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma;font-size:13px\">\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma;font-size:13px\">\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma;font-size:13px\">\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma;font-size:13px\">\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma;font-size:13px\">\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma;font-size:13px\">\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma;font-size:13px\">\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma;font-size:13px\">\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma;font-size:13px\">\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma;font-size:13px\">\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma;font-size:13px\">\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma;font-size:13px\">\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma;font-size:13px\">\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma;font-size:13px\">\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma;font-size:13px\">\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma;font-size:13px\">\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma;font-size:13px\">\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma;font-size:13px\">\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma;font-size:13px\">\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma;font-size:13px\"><font face=\"Tahoma\">_____________________________________________________________<br>\r\n</font></div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma;font-size:13px\"><font face=\"Tahoma\"><br>\r\n</font></div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma;font-size:13px\"><font face=\"Taho